#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``n_batches = 1``: Number of batches of configurations used by the different calls to the eigenstate solver\n"
msgstr "``n_batches = 1``: Bilang ng mga batch ng configuration na ginagamit ng iba't ibang tawag sa eigenstate solver\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "``samples_per_batch = 2``: Number of unique configurations to include in each batch\n"
msgstr "``samples_per_batch = 2``: Bilang ng mga natatanging configuration na isasama sa bawat batch\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Obtain decimal representation of the spin-up and spin-down bitstrings used by the eigenstate solver.\n"
msgstr "Kunin ang decimal na representasyon ng mga spin-up at spin-down na bitstring na ginagamit ng eigenstate solver.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The first element in the tuple corresponds to the decimal representation of the spin-up configurations, while the second element in the tuple corresponds to the decimal representation of the spin-down configurations:\n"
msgstr "Ang unang elemento sa tuple ay tumutugma sa decimal na representasyon ng mga spin-up na configuration, habang ang ikalawang elemento sa tuple ay tumutugma sa decimal na representasyon ng mga spin-down na configuration:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that while the number of samples per batch is two, and the sampled bitstrings are: $00010010$ and $01001000$, four electronic configurations are generated per spin-species. In this case, the set of unique spin-polarized configurations is given by:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U} = \\{ 0001, 0010, 0100, 1000 \\}\n"
"$$\n"
"whose base-10 decimal representation is\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U}_{10} = \\{ 1, 2, 4, 8 \\}\n"
"$$\n"
"Basis of the subspace:\n"
msgstr ""
"Tandaan na kahit dalawa ang bilang ng mga sample bawat batch, at ang mga na-sample na bitstring ay: $00010010$ at $01001000$, apat na electronic configuration ang nabubuo bawat spin-species. Sa kasong ito, ang set ng mga natatanging spin-polarized na configuration ay:\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U} = \\{ 0001, 0010, 0100, 1000 \\}\n"
"$$\n"
"na ang base-10 na decimal na representasyon ay\n"
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U}_{10} = \\{ 1, 2, 4, 8 \\}\n"
"$$\n"
"Basis ng subspace:\n"

